<article class="env-example" id="F45FF3">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/F45FF3">Example <span data-tag="F45FF3">6.2.2.2</span>.</a> Any $\infty $-category $\calC $ may be equipped with the <em>trivial topology</em>, in which a sieve $\calC ^{(0)}_{/C}$ on an object $C$ of $\calC $ is covering if and only if $\calC ^{(0)}_{/C} = \calC _{/C}$. </p>
